    // Clear back stack (e.g., after logout)
    private fun logout() {
        findNavController().navigate(
            R.id.loginFragment,
            null,
            NavOptions.Builder()
                .setPopUpTo(R.id.nav_graph, true)  // Clear all
                .build()
        )
    }
}
```

**Key Points:**
- ✅ Define all routes in navigation graph
- ✅ Use Safe Args for type-safety
- ✅ `findNavController().navigate()` for navigation
- ✅ `navigateUp()` for back navigation
- ✅ `setPopUpTo()` to clear back stack
- ✅ Deep linking works automatically

